\f1\fs22 \'93A cabinet meeting on a Sunday morning, your Serene Corporateness?\'94 the Director of Moral Observance complained as he crabbed his corpulent butt into a chair at the board table. The chair creaked, despite its lofty brand, high design values and sturdy construction. \'93I\'92m expected at church.\'94\
